<div class="card page-wide">
  <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:0;"><a href="/ca">&larr; CA / Accounting</a></p>
  <h1>Financial Year Lock</h1>
  <p class="muted">Once a financial year is locked here, every CA write path that touches that year's data — recording or removing an INR actual, the assumed exchange rate, a FIRC/eBRC reference, an expense's TDS annotation, and matching/unmatching a bank statement line — is blocked, so a closed year's numbers can't be quietly changed after the CA has signed off on them. Someone holding the "Override a financial year lock" permission (or a Super Admin) can still push through a single genuine correction — see Recent Overrides below.</p>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Financial Years</h2>
    {% if years.length == 0 %}
      <p class="muted">No financial year has any CA activity yet.</p>
    {% else %}
      <table class="list">
        <tr><th>Financial Year</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr>
        {% for fy in years %}
          {% set isLocked = fy in lockedYears %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ fy }}</td>
            <td>
              {% if isLocked %}
                <span style="color:var(--danger)">Locked</span>
              {% else %}
                <span style="color:var(--success)">Open</span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if isLocked %}
                <form method="post" action="/ca/fy-locks/unlock" style="display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
                  <input type="hidden" name="financial_year" value="{{ fy }}">
                  <input type="text" name="unlock_reason" placeholder="Reason for reopening *" required style="min-width:220px;">
                  <button type="submit" class="btn-sm btn-secondary" onclick="return confirm('Reopen FY {{ fy }} for CA data entry?');">Unlock</button>
                </form>
              {% else %}
                <form method="post" action="/ca/fy-locks/lock" onsubmit="return confirm('Lock FY {{ fy }}? No CA data entry against that year will be accepted until it is reopened.');">
                  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
                  <input type="hidden" name="financial_year" value="{{ fy }}">
                  <button type="submit" class="btn-sm">Lock</button>
                </form>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Lock / Unlock History</h2>
    <p class="muted small">Independent of the main system audit log — every lock and unlock, who did it and (for an unlock) why, stays on record even after a year is reopened and re-locked.</p>
    {% if history.length == 0 %}
      <p class="muted">No financial year has ever been locked.</p>
    {% else %}
      <table class="list">
        <tr><th>Financial Year</th><th>Locked</th><th>Unlocked</th><th>Unlock Reason</th></tr>
        {% for row in history %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ row.financial_year }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.locked_at }}{% if row.locked_by %} by {{ usersById[row.locked_by] or ('User #' ~ row.locked_by) }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td>
            {% if row.unlocked_at != null %}
              {{ row.unlocked_at }}{% if row.unlocked_by %} by {{ usersById[row.unlocked_by] or ('User #' ~ row.unlocked_by) }}{% endif %}
            {% else %}
              <span class="muted">Still locked</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td class="muted small">{{ row.unlock_reason or '' }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Recent Overrides</h2>
    <p class="muted small">Every time someone with the override permission pushes through a CA entry against a locked financial year — also on record in the main audit log under CA_FY_LOCK_OVERRIDDEN.</p>
    {% if recentOverrides.length == 0 %}
      <p class="muted">No financial year lock has ever been overridden.</p>
    {% else %}
      <table class="list">
        <tr><th>When</th><th>By</th><th>Field</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
        {% for row in recentOverrides %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ row.created_at }}</td>
          <td>{{ (usersById[row.user_id] or ('User #' ~ row.user_id)) if row.user_id else '—' }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.entity_type or '' }}{% if row.entity_id %} #{{ row.entity_id }}{% endif %} — {{ row.field_name or '' }}</td>
          <td class="muted small">{{ row.new_value or '' }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
